{"3274710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "4 Penny Coffins", "steam_appid": 3274710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/35a6a69b8e6a0a6a1e5c9eafe74e8d2b.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/35a6a69b8e6a0a6a1e5c9eafe74e8d2b.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are dangerous. Fear spreads with every body found. In <i>4 Penny Coffins</i>, one player takes on the role of the Ripper - a demonic murderer with the urge to kill - while others work to uncover the truth before the next murder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/0eaa88433f7246c2f6d7617595f91b66.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/0eaa88433f7246c2f6d7617595f91b66.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the typical social deception genre! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence from crime scenes, question suspects, track suspicious behavior, and piece together clues. The Ripper must deceive and redirect suspicion while avoiding detection. Investigators must separate fact from fiction before paranoia tears the group apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is fragile. Evidence can be faked. And time is not on your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/b11f723debb88ba2ccdd72fcc29af10c.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/b11f723debb88ba2ccdd72fcc29af10c.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night follows a deliberate three-phase cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ripper hunts. Players investigate. Then, in a formal and organized Conviction phase, evidence is weighed and a verdict is delivered. No endless shouting. No stalled discussions. Every round reaches a resolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/da2b836b1ece37db7758b4a13eaef17f.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/da2b836b1ece37db7758b4a13eaef17f.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic roles and player-driven outcomes, every session unfolds differently. Playable solo or in multiplayer, <i>4 Penny Coffins</i> blends social deduction with investigative mechanics to create tense, unpredictable matches where trust is earned slowly and lost instantly. Someone will hang for these crimes. Make sure it isn’t you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/35a6a69b8e6a0a6a1e5c9eafe74e8d2b.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/35a6a69b8e6a0a6a1e5c9eafe74e8d2b.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are dangerous. Fear spreads with every body found. In <i>4 Penny Coffins</i>, one player takes on the role of the Ripper - a demonic murderer with the urge to kill - while others work to uncover the truth before the next murder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/0eaa88433f7246c2f6d7617595f91b66.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/0eaa88433f7246c2f6d7617595f91b66.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the typical social deception genre! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence from crime scenes, question suspects, track suspicious behavior, and piece together clues. The Ripper must deceive and redirect suspicion while avoiding detection. Investigators must separate fact from fiction before paranoia tears the group apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is fragile. Evidence can be faked. And time is not on your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/b11f723debb88ba2ccdd72fcc29af10c.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/b11f723debb88ba2ccdd72fcc29af10c.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night follows a deliberate three-phase cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ripper hunts. Players investigate. Then, in a formal and organized Conviction phase, evidence is weighed and a verdict is delivered. No endless shouting. No stalled discussions. Every round reaches a resolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras/da2b836b1ece37db7758b4a13eaef17f.avif?t=1787927382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/extras_big/da2b836b1ece37db7758b4a13eaef17f.webp?t=1787927382 width=1560 height=150 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic roles and player-driven outcomes, every session unfolds differently. Playable solo or in multiplayer, <i>4 Penny Coffins</i> blends social deduction with investigative mechanics to create tense, unpredictable matches where trust is earned slowly and lost instantly. Someone will hang for these crimes. Make sure it isn’t you.</p>", "short_description": "In 4 Penny Coffins, up to 8 players hunt a hidden murderer through lies, shifting alibis, and hard evidence in our online multiplayer mode. This social investigation game also includes a solo mode for those brave enough to face the fog alone.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/1d26e3812bceebd79ef2642522a39b15f4da0257/header.jpg?t=1787927382", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/622632c69eb533e9a1fe688959fb2f9fcef18367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787927382", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274710/622632c69eb533e9a1fe688959fb2f9fcef18367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787927382", "website": "https://4pennycoffins.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12450H @ 2.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Other Ocean Interactive"], "publishers": ["Other Ocean Group"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "